# Backend Gmail & Notification Configuration
# To generate a Gmail App Password:
# 1. Go to Google Account (myaccount.google.com) -> Security
# 2. Ensure 2-Step Verification is ON
# 3. Under 2-Step Verification, select "App Passwords"
# 4. Create a new App Password named "Marcos Wine Bar" and copy the 16-character code
GMAIL_USER=marco@marcoswinebar.com.au
GMAIL_APP_PASSWORD=xxxx xxxx xxxx xxxx
ALERT_EMAIL_RECIPIENT=marco@marcoswinebar.com.au
